   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 5,
   "to": 7.45
  },
  {
   "content": "没有结束这回事",
   "from": 7.45,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 6,
   "to": 8.65
  },
  {
   "content": "只有下一个任务",
   "from": 8.65,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 7,
   "to": 10.03
  },
  {
   "content": "精锐部队破解了大多数人难以坚持的秘诀",
   "from": 10.03,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 8,
   "to": 13.45
  },
  {
   "content": "人们从未弄懂",
   "from": 13.45,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 9,
   "to": 15.02
  },
  {
   "content": "我将展示一个能让人类在极端压力下保持功能的实战框架",
   "from": 15.02,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 10,
   "to": 19.95
  },
  {
   "content": "你已被灌输认为",
   "from": 19.95,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 11,
   "to": 21.35
  },
  {
   "content": "恢复只在一切停止后发生",
   "from": 21.35,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 12,
   "to": 23.67
  },
  {
   "content": "当截止日期结束时",
   "from": 23.67,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 13,
   "to": 24.89
  },
  {
   "content": "当周末到来时",
   "from": 24.89,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 14,
   "to": 26.13
  },
  {
   "content": "当局势平缓时",
   "from": 26.13,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 15,
   "to": 27.23
  },
  {
   "content": "但局势不会平缓",
   "from": 27.23,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 16,
   "to": 28.74
  },
  {
   "content": "休息不是工作后的选择",
   "from": 28.74,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 17,
   "to": 30.92
  },
  {
   "content": "它是作战环境中主动融入工作的战术要素",
   "from": 30.92,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 18,
   "to": 34.46
  },
  {
   "content": "休息不会安排在之后",
   "from": 34.46,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 19,
   "to": 36.18
  },
  {
   "content": "这是实时管理的战术资源",
   "from": 36.18,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 20,
   "to": 38.74
  },
  {
   "content": "军队使用三个特定系统实现这一点",
   "from": 38.74,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 21,
   "to": 41.78
  },
  {
   "content": "第一个系统是任何持续行动中的轮换机制",
   "from": 41.78,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 22,
   "to": 44.9
  },
  {
   "content": "士兵被轮换",
   "from": 44.9,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 23,
   "to": 46.2
  },
  {
   "content": "而非",
   "from": 46.2,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 24,
   "to": 46.66
  },
  {
   "content": "所有人保持高度警戒",
   "from": 46.66,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 25,
   "to": 47.62
  },
  {
   "content": "同时",
   "from": 47.62,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 26,
   "to": 48.52
  },
  {
   "content": "部队轮换",
   "from": 48.52,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 27,
   "to": 49.69
  },
  {
   "content": "部分处于行动",
   "from": 49.69,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 28,
   "to": 50.59
  },
  {
   "content": "部分待命",
   "from": 50.59,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 29,
   "to": 51.85
  },
  {
   "content": "部分真正休整",
   "from": 51.85,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 30,
   "to": 53.39
  },
  {
   "content": "即使任务中途",
   "from": 53.39,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 31,
   "to": 54.49
  },
  {
   "content": "士兵被刻意安排休整",
   "from": 54.49,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 32,
   "to": 56.35
  },
  {
   "content": "确保随时能投入战斗",
   "from": 56.35,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 33,
   "to": 57.95
  },
  {
   "content": "军方深知持续高强度输出并非最有效的人力使用方式",
   "from": 57.95,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 34,
   "to": 63.12
  },
  {
   "content": "科学证实这一点",
   "from": 63.12,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 35,
   "to": 64.97
  },
  {
   "content": "纳撒尼尔·克莱曼",
   "from": 64.97,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 36,
   "to": 66.19
  },
  {
   "content": "发现REM睡眠的研究者",
   "from": 66.19,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 37,
   "to": 68.07
  },
  {
   "content": "发现大脑全天自然循环约90分钟的专注与恢复周期",
   "from": 68.07,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 38,
   "to": 73.27
  },
  {
   "content": "不仅限于睡眠时",
   "from": 73.27,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 39,
   "to": 74.44
  },
  {
   "content": "他称之为基本休息活动周期",
   "from": 74.44,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 40,
   "to": 76.56
  },
  {
   "content": "你的大脑天生具备轮换机制",
   "from": 76.56,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 41,
   "to": 78.7
  },
  {
   "content": "大多数人只是强行压制",
   "from": 78.7,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 42,
   "to": 80.35
  },
  {
   "content": "让我展示这个过程",
   "from": 80.35,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 43,
   "to": 81.71
  },
  {
   "content": "通过两名真实士兵",
   "from": 81.71,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 44,
   "to": 82.91
  },
  {
   "content": "士兵A和士兵B",
   "from": 82.91,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 45,
   "to": 84.77
  },
  {
   "content": "同一战场",
   "from": 84.77,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 46,
   "to": 85.81
  },
  {
   "content": "相同任务六小时",
   "from": 85.81,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 47,
   "to": 87.39
  },
  {
   "content": "守卫周界",
   "from": 87.39,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 48,
   "to": 88.62
  },
  {
   "content": "士兵A决定不停止",
   "from": 88.62,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 49,
   "to": 90.85
  },
  {
   "content": "枪不离手",
   "from": 90.85,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 50,
   "to": 92.87
  },
  {
   "content": "睁开眼睛",
   "from": 92.87,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 51,
   "to": 93.77
  },
  {
   "content": "从一开始就全力以赴",
   "from": 93.77,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 52,
   "to": 95.75
  },
  {
   "content": "他认为坚持就是职业军人该做的事",
   "from": 95.75,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 53,
   "to": 98.59
  },
  {
   "content": "士兵B站在同一防线",
   "from": 98.59,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 54,
   "to": 100.85
  },
  {
   "content": "面对相同的威胁和高温",
   "from": 100.85,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 55,
   "to": 102.89
  },
  {
   "content": "但他每90分钟有一套系统",
   "from": 102.89,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 56,
   "to": 105.61
  },
  {
   "content": "士兵B从岗位后退15分钟",
   "from": 105.61,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 57,
   "to": 108.61
  },
  {
   "content": "他找到一面墙",
   "from": 108.61,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 58,
   "to": 109.73
  },
  {
   "content": "背靠墙壁",
   "from": 109.73,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 59,
   "to": 110.95
  },
  {
   "content": "闭眼缓慢呼吸直到身体放松",
   "from": 110.95,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 60,
   "to": 114.539
  },
  {
   "content": "然后起身返回岗位",
   "from": 114.539,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 61,
   "to": 116.959
  },
  {
   "content": "他在六小时中重复两次",
   "from": 116.959,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 62,
   "to": 119.379
  },
  {
   "content": "六小时任务中获得30分钟休息",
   "from": 119.379,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 63,
   "to": 122.0
  },
  {
   "content": "现在问题是第五小时时",
   "from": 122.0,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 64,
   "to": 123.94
  },
  {
   "content": "当威胁出现时选哪个士兵守防",
   "from": 123.94,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 65,
   "to": 127.68
  },
  {
   "content": "任务并不在意士兵A的奉献",
   "from": 127.68,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 66,
   "to": 131.14
  },
  {
   "content": "只关心防线是否真正安全",
   "from": 131.14,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 67,
   "to": 134.19
  },
  {
   "content": "在第五小时最关键的时刻",
   "from": 134.19,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 68,
   "to": 136.49
  },
  {
   "content": "只有他还能完成任务",
   "from": 136.49,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 69,
   "to": 139.53
  },
  {
   "content": "轮换意味着",
   "from": 139.53,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 70,
   "to": 140.49
  },
  {
   "content": "别像单节电池般耗尽能量",
   "from": 140.49,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 71,
   "to": 142.73
  },
  {
   "content": "直到耗尽为止",
   "from": 142.73,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 72,
   "to": 143.63
  },
  {
   "content": "分阶段工作",
   "from": 143.63,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 73,
   "to": 145.18
  },
  {
   "content": "专注高强度任务",
   "from": 145.18,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 74,
   "to": 147.24
  },
  {
   "content": "随后进行真正恢复时间",
   "from": 147.24,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 75,
   "to": 149.36
  },
  {
   "content": "尽早完成最艰巨任务时精力最充沛",
   "from": 149.36,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 76,
   "to": 151.96
  },
  {
   "content": "在感到疲惫前减缓节奏",
   "from": 151.96,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 77,
   "to": 153.8
  },
  {
   "content": "关键是在需要前主动休息",
   "from": 153.8,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 78,
   "to": 156.7
  },
  {
   "content": "第二个系统是碎片化睡眠在持续任务中",
   "from": 156.7,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 79,
   "to": 161.08
  },
  {
   "content": "士兵几乎得不到整块睡眠",
   "from": 161.08,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 80,
   "to": 163.64
  },
  {
   "content": "他们分段睡眠",
   "from": 163.64,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 81,
   "to": 164.82
  },
  {
   "content": "有时20到30分钟间隔",
   "from": 164.82,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 82,
   "to": 166.74
  },
  {
   "content": "尽可能时",
   "from": 166.74,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 83,
   "to": 167.58
  },
  {
   "content": "他们靠墙坐着或在移动车辆中",
   "from": 167.58,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 84,
   "to": 171.98
  },
  {
   "content": "因为他们明白短暂恢复胜过无恢复",
   "from": 171.98,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 85,
   "to": 175.94
  },
  {
   "content": "经典军用小睡是20分钟",
   "from": 175.94,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 86,
   "to": 178.18
  },
  {
   "content": "2021年有精确原因",
   "from": 178.18,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 87,
   "to": 181.07
  },
  {
   "content": "美",
   "from": 181.07,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 88,
   "to": 181.39
  },
  {
   "content": "在官方军事睡眠报告中",
   "from": 185.69,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 89,
   "to": 188.53
  },
  {
   "content": "20分钟捕捉浅睡阶段",
   "from": 188.53,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 90,
   "to": 190.51
  },
  {
   "content": "提供身体修复和神经重置",
   "from": 190.51,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 91,
   "to": 193.51
  },
  {
   "content": "但未进入深层慢波睡眠",
   "from": 193.51,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 92,
   "to": 195.76
  },
  {
   "content": "醒来时不会出现昏沉感",
   "from": 195.76,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 93,
   "to": 197.76
  },
  {
   "content": "那种叫睡眠惯性",
   "from": 197.76,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 94,
   "to": 200.48
  },
  {
   "content": "国立生物技术信息中心研究证实",
   "from": 200.48,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 95,
   "to": 205.4
  },
  {
   "content": "30分钟内小睡大多避免惯性",
   "from": 205.4,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 96,
   "to": 207.1
  },
  {
   "content": "而更长时间会持续引发",
   "from": 207.1,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 97,
   "to": 209.91
  },
  {
   "content": "这意味着20分钟休息并非无用",
   "from": 209.91,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 98,
   "to": 212.34
  },
  {
   "content": "闭上眼睛",
   "from": 212.34,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 99,
   "to": 213.26
  },
  {
   "content": "让自己放松下来",
   "from": 213.26,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 100,
   "to": 214.39
  },
  {
   "content": "你会感受到多年未有的午后活力",
   "from": 214.39,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 101,
   "to": 218.33
  },
  {
   "content": "第三个系统是微恢复法",
   "from": 218.33,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 102,
   "to": 220.95
  },
  {
   "content": "有时士兵没有二十分钟",
   "from": 220.95,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 103,
   "to": 223.03
  },
  {
   "content": "有时只有九十秒",
   "from": 223.03,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 104,
   "to": 224.73
  },
  {
   "content": "但他们被训练利用这些时刻",
   "from": 224.73,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 105,
   "to": 226.47
  },
  {
   "content": "有意识地",
   "from": 226.47,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 106,
   "to": 227.23
  },
  {
   "content": "战术呼吸旨在将神经系统从战斗或逃跑模式切换到恢复状态",
   "from": 227.23,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 107,
   "to": 231.23
  },
  {
   "content": "在两分钟内",
   "from": 231.23,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
   "sid": 108,
   "to": 232.35
  },
  {
   "content": "美国",
   "from": 232.35,
   "location": 2,
   "music": 0.0,
